      "statement": "In Cilium 1.17.0, MTU auto-detection uses the lowest MTU of all external interfaces instead of only the primary interface (except in ENI mode, where secondary interfaces are not considered); manually configured MTU via the `MTU` helm option, `--mtu` agent flag or CNI `mtu` option still applies."
